1
00:00:06,426 --> 00:00:08,256
(sniffs)

2
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:09,261
(Leonard:)Morning.

3
00:00:09,262 --> 00:00:10,862
(Penny:)Hi. Want to do
yoga with me?

4
00:00:10,864 --> 00:00:12,494
(Leonard:)Um, let me just have
some coffee first,

5
00:00:12,499 --> 00:00:14,569
(Leonard:)and then I'll have
the strength to tell you

6
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:16,897
(Leonard:)how much I won't be doing that.

7
00:00:16,903 --> 00:00:19,833
(phone ringing)

8
00:00:19,839 --> 00:00:21,039
(Leonard:)Hello?

9
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:23,011
(Sheldon:)Hello, Leonard.

10
00:00:23,009 --> 00:00:25,979
(Leonard:)Hey, buddy.
Good to hear your voice.

11
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:27,549
(Sheldon:)Uh, I'm in Kingman, Arizona,

12
00:00:27,547 --> 00:00:30,987
(Sheldon:)and, uh, I need you
to come pick me up.

13
00:00:30,984 --> 00:00:32,914
(Leonard:)I'd love to.

14
00:00:32,919 --> 00:00:35,389
(Leonard:)I'm just about
to do yoga with Penny.

15
00:00:37,323 --> 00:00:39,253
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I'm at
the police station.

16
00:00:39,259 --> 00:00:40,259
(Sheldon:)I was robbed.

17
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,790
Th-They took my phone,

18
00:00:41,795 --> 00:00:43,995
(Sheldon:)my wallet, my iPad, everything.

19
00:00:43,997 --> 00:00:45,197
(Leonard:)Oh, my God, are you okay?

20
00:00:45,198 --> 00:00:46,198
(Scene:)No,

21
00:00:46,199 --> 00:00:47,299
(Sheldon:)I'm not okay.

22
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,170
I-I'm wearing borrowed pants,

23
00:00:49,169 --> 00:00:51,269
I-I don't have I.D.,

24
00:00:51,271 --> 00:00:52,741
(Sheldon:)and one of the officers here

25
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,169
(Sheldon:)won't stop calling me
Chicken Legs.

26
00:00:55,175 --> 00:00:56,575
(Leonard:)Okay.

27
00:00:56,576 --> 00:00:57,776
Uh, I'll-I'll
come get you.

28
00:00:57,777 --> 00:00:58,777
(Leonard:)What's the address?

29
00:00:58,778 --> 00:00:59,848
(Penny:)Hey, what's going on?
Oh.

30
00:00:59,846 --> 00:01:01,316
(Leonard:)He got all of
his stuff stolen.

